From 75be8b106654b251cc4bee83df0f2a072036d502 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 21:04:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] microblaze: Implement ____longjmp_chk using the generic
 Linux version

The MicroBlaze ____longjmp_chk has been a placeholder since the port
was added in 2012:

	ENTRY (____longjmp_chk)
		rtsd	r15,0
		nop

It never jumps.  Worse, "rtsd r15,0" returns to the address of the
call instruction itself rather than past its delay slot, so
__longjmp_chk calls ____longjmp_chk, which returns to the call, which
calls it again, forever.  Every longjmp or siglongjmp compiled with
_FORTIFY_SOURCE hangs on MicroBlaze.  GDB defines _FORTIFY_SOURCE=2
by default (gdbsupport/common-defs.h) and uses longjmp to propagate
errors out of the readline callback, so a native gdb spins forever
on the first error it handles.

Remove the stub and provide JB_FRAME_ADDRESS so that the generic
sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/____longjmp_chk.c is used instead, the same
way riscv and loongarch do.

Tested on a microblazeel-linux-gnu cross build run under qemu-user:
debug/tst-longjmp_chk, tst-longjmp_chk2 and tst-longjmp_chk3 time
out before this change and pass after it.

Assisted-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../jmpbuf-offsets.h}                           | 17 +++++------------
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 rename sysdeps/{unix/sysv/linux/microblaze/____longjmp_chk.S => microblaze/jmpbuf-offsets.h} (74%)

diff --git a/sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/microblaze/____longjmp_chk.S b/sysdeps/microblaze/jmpbuf-offsets.h
similarity index 74%
rename from sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/microblaze/____longjmp_chk.S
rename to sysdeps/microblaze/jmpbuf-offsets.h
index 92b30169..ab74896a 100644
--- a/sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/microblaze/____longjmp_chk.S
+++ b/sysdeps/microblaze/jmpbuf-offsets.h
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
-/* Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
-
+/* Private macros for accessing __jmp_buf contents.  MicroBlaze version.
+   Copyright (C) 2026 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
    This file is part of the GNU C Library.
 
    The GNU C Library is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
@@ -16,14 +16,7 @@
    License along with the GNU C Library; if not, see
    <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.  */
 
-#include <sysdep.h>
+#include <jmpbuf-unwind.h>
 
-	.text
-ENTRY (__revisit_longjmp_chk)
-	rtsd	r15,0
-	nop
-PSEUDO_END (__revisit_longjmp_chk)
-ENTRY (____longjmp_chk)
-	rtsd	r15,0
-	nop
-PSEUDO_END (____longjmp_chk)
+/* Helper for generic ____longjmp_chk().  */
+#define JB_FRAME_ADDRESS(buf) ((void *) _jmpbuf_sp (buf))
